    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Seamus Carthy present New to Market a 4-bedroom residence on approximately 0.5 acres, requiring refurbishment and offering excellent potential to create a modern family home. Subject to satisfying the relevant scheme criteria, eligible to qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, with the potential for additional funding under the Derelict Top-Up grant where applicable. This presents purchasers with an excellent opportunity to significantly offset renovation costs. Enquiries and viewings now invited \n\nOutside\nMature residential site extending to approximately 0.5 acres Excellent countryside views"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Four-bedroom residence requiring complete refurbishment\nEligible purchasers may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (subject to approval). \nhttps://www.gov.ie/en/department-of-housing-local-government-and-heritage/services/vacant-property-refurbishment-grant/\nExcellent opportunity to modernise and create a superb family home\nAttractive rural location with significant potential for owner occupiers and investors alike\nResidence consists of 4 Bedrooms (1 ensuite), central living room, Bathroom, Kitchen, Utility. \n Electricty currently disconnected\nWater on Site\nSeptic Tank on Site"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
